Modifications made in version 1.1.0 (this repository):

- dell_fans_controller/GpuProbe.cs        (new) reads GPU temperature/fan speed with nvidia-smi,
                          maps temperature to a fan level with hysteresis,
                          and applies fan speed through ipmitool
                          (raw 0x30 0x30 0x01 0x00/0x01, raw 0x30 0x30 0x02 <fan> <pct>).
- dell_fans_controller/GpuFanControl.cs   (new) "GPU Auto Control" panel in the main window:
                          enable switch, polling interval, quiet speed, hysteresis,
                          three temperature tiers, per-fan GPU binding (F1..F6),
                          live temperature / applied-speed status lines,
                          persistence in the [gpu] section of config.ini,
                          and a change log written to gpu_control.log.
- dell_fans_controller/FormMain.cs        hosts the panel, keeps iDRAC credentials in sync, warns when a
                          manual fan button is pressed while auto control is active,
                          turns auto control off on "Reset to Auto Mode",
                          stops the worker thread on exit, adaptive window layout.
- dell_fans_controller.csproj             target framework v2.0 -> v4.0, two new source files, dell.ico.
- build.rsp, tools/mkres.cs, build.cmd    (new) command-line build with the .NET Framework
                          csc.exe, no Visual Studio and no resgen.exe required.
- config.ini.example, docs/, release/     (new) sample config, UI screenshots, built executable.
